# One motif, one statement in each timbre, softest to brightest, ten seconds each, alone: to pick favourites. Not one of the tests. Evolve 0: the
# same motif each time. Which timbre at which time: "mel" lines in the trace, a bar is 1.41 s.
#   PYTHON=.venv/bin/python3 sh build.sh --host && mkdir -p app/build/listen && app/build/host/aq1_host tests/listen/melody_timbres.amb app/build/listen
# (in Auto, saved, as it boots: this is the arranger's, from the top. Hands is the power-on's: hands.amb, preset_*.amb)
press SEL
tap HOME
release SEL
tap SAVE
wait 800
reboot
master 2430
tap PLAY
wait 200
seed 5
style liquid
setpar 2 0
setpar 4 0
setpar 12 0
setpar 16 0
wait 200
trace app/build/listen/melody_timbres.trace
wav melody_timbres.wav
tap PLAY
wait 100
melhear 0
wait 10000
melhear 1
wait 10000
melhear 2
wait 10000
melhear 3
wait 10000
melhear 4
wait 10000
melhear 5
wait 10000
wavstop
trace off
